      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 640,
        "height": 544,
        "content": "## Collect and shape prompt\n\nStarts the workflow from the user form and uses the first AI agent, supported by its Groq model and structured output parser, to turn the submission into a clean image-generation prompt."
